{"id":"vod_lz_857","vodId":"857","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"小林家的龙女仆","name_cn":"小林家的龙女仆","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全集","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220323-1/fe6e1e0a7391d5845a0b3c726995fcb8.jpg"},"summary":"小林（田村睦心 配音）是一位非常平凡的程序员，在一次偶然之中救了一条名叫托尔（桑原由气 配音）的龙，为了报答小林的救命之恩，托尔化身成为了女仆的样子来到了小林家中，就这样，小林和龙女仆的同居生活就此拉开序幕。                                                                     　　古灵精怪我行我素的康娜卡姆依（长绳麻理亚 配音）、对人类有着非常深的成见，但似乎不太聪明的样子的艾露玛（高田忧希 配音）、心思细腻温柔又稳重的大姐姐露科亚（高桥未奈美 配音）、痛恨着人类，但又无法自持的被人类所发明出来的游戏所吸引的法夫纳（小野大辅 配音），自托尔之后，小林的身边接二连三的出现了这些性格迥异的龙族们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-03-25 17:33:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/169_0d63d8ad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/171_72538664/index.m3u8"},{"name":"03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/170_5e062c0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/172_21f3d73e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/173_c298fffb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/174_2d5a4bfe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/176_3a656d69/index.m3u8"},{"name":"08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/175_e649e508/index.m3u8"},{"name":"09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/177_5d234f8f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/179_6667d4b3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/178_620757b3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/181_46a8ea85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/180_a1a45416/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:57.045Z"}